```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph Scan["1. Semgrep 静态扫描"]
        SG[SemgrepScanner] --> |sink 点| SINK["Sinks<br/>(SQL注入/命令注入/XXE/...)<br/>234 findings"]
        SG --> |API 路由| ROUTE["Routes<br/>(Spring @GetMapping/@PostMapping/...)<br/>API endpoints"]
    end

    subgraph Trace["2. 污点追踪"]
        RT[ReverseTracer<br/>逆向溯源专家] --> |场景A: 追到入口| TRACE_OK["完整调用链<br/>vuln_type + entry_route<br/>+ call_chain"]
        RT --> |场景B: 微服务边界| CROSS["跨界求救<br/>cross_service_trace"]
        RT --> |场景C: 链路断裂| NOT_EXP["NOT_EXPLOITABLE"]
    end

    subgraph Logic["2. 业务逻辑审查"]
        LA[LogicAuditor<br/>业务逻辑推演专家] --> |发现缺陷| LOGIC_VULN["IDOR / 缺鉴权 /<br/>硬编码后门 / 竞态..."]
        LA --> |逻辑严密| LOGIC_DEF["DEFENDED"]
    end

    subgraph Red["3. 红队攻击验证"]
        RV[RedValidator<br/>红队攻击专家] --> |可利用| EXPLOIT["EXPLOITABLE<br/>attack_vector + poc_payload<br/>+ max_impact"]
        RV --> |不可利用| NOT_EXP2["NOT_EXPLOITABLE<br/>+ defense_analysis"]
    end

    subgraph Blue["4. 蓝队防御核查"]
        BV[BlueValidator<br/>蓝队防御专家] --> |防御无效| VULN["VULNERABLE<br/>完整漏洞报告<br/>+ mitigation_advice"]
        BV --> |防御有效| DEFENDED["DEFENDED<br/>+ defense_analysis"]
    end

    subgraph Report["5. 报告生成"]
        RPT[build_summary_report] --> SUMMARY["SUMMARY.md<br/>按严重度/类型/文件汇总<br/>+ 漏洞清单 + PoC"]
    end

    %% 主流程：Sink 路径
    SINK --> |需要污点追踪| RT
